        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset BRL, Classic Drop Tail Brooklane Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nExquisite curves are incorporated into the sweeping design of the Brooklane Lever making it a great choice for both contemporary or traditional settings. This Kwikset BRL Leverset's decorative rose combined with the drop tail style is popular choice for design professionals. With an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for door 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick, it fits standard pre-drilled doors. Available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Kwikset Brooklane Door Lever Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick SmartKey system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed levers (except half dummy function).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kwikset BRL Brooklane Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive lever for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational lever is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock on both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Half Dummy Levers are Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other Brooklane Lever functions are non-handed.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
